  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the ancient symbolism and mythical beauty of the Tree of Life with this Custom Quilt Set by Jeminise. Featuring an intricate design inspired by fantasy mythology and Yggdrasil, this soft bedding set offers lightweight warmth for the summer and cozy comfort during the winter. Perfectly suited for nature lovers, this custom-made quilt enhances any farmhouse or rustic bedroom decor while providing year-round versatility.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt with unique text options or special requests to make a truly personalized bedding piece or heartfelt gift.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Material:</strong> Made from 100% breathable polyester with a soft outer fabric layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for maximum comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Seasonal Comfort:</strong> Designed to offer lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy insulation during the winter seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multi-Functional Use:</strong> Perfect as a bed quilt, cozy throw blanket, decorative picnic mat, or camping blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric that dries quickly and resists pilling, fading, and wrinkling over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your custom bedding set by selecting the option to include matching pillowcases.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Flowers, Fantasy Mythology</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Yggdrasil</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree of Life-ds14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Optional Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
